      "content": "idk i'm kinda scared to go to the doctor right now bc it's expensive and i really dont want to wait weeks for an appt. do u think i could just try some intense stretching or maybe try to like 'crack' my back to see if i can reset something? maybe if i stretch it out it'll stop the shooting feeling?",
